WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:04.208
Morning, Retsuko.

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:06.500
Oh, hi, Fenneko.

00:00:07.041 --> 00:00:08.791
It's morning and I'm tired already.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:11.083
I just ran into Tsunoda downstairs.

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:12.791
Tsunoda...

00:00:13.625 --> 00:00:14.791
I hate that girl.

00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:15.708
Really?

00:00:16.166 --> 00:00:17.541
I'm not fond of her, either.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.666
I'm following her online, though.

00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:23.916
Based on my analysis,
there's a pattern here.

00:00:24.208 --> 00:00:25.333
A pattern?

00:00:25.416 --> 00:00:29.166
She uploads photos
as if she's an idol.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.708
Take a look.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:34.458
Selfie, dessert, latte art.
Selfie, dessert, latte art.

00:00:34.916 --> 00:00:38.625
Selfie, dessert. Selfie, dessert.
Selfie, selfie, her bare thighs.

00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:42.875
She posts a thigh pic
once every 13 days, without fail.

00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:44.333
I'll say it again.

00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:47.708
-Selfie, dessert, latte art. Selfie--
-Yeah, I get it.

00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:50.375
It's not the drink she's showing off here.

00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:51.750
It's her thighs.

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:52.708
You see?

00:00:53.916 --> 00:00:56.375
She posted a picture
of her legs again on Saturday -

00:00:56.708 --> 00:00:58.791
three days earlier
than her usual pattern.

00:00:59.041 --> 00:01:01.833
She must have found a man
she wanted to show this to.

00:01:02.166 --> 00:01:04.833
I highly suspect
it was at Friday's office party.

00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:07.416
Oh, good morning, Fenneko!

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:08.916
Good morning.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.083
Hey, did you get your nails done?

00:01:11.166 --> 00:01:12.416
Oh! That's right!

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.458
I went to a new place.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:16.541
Wow. They look really good.

